<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 621.11, up 1.54, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.09.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 280 to 273.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,165,400 compared with 22,901,995 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
